Repeal gun free zones and preemption
HB0172
amendments.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Haroldson, Angelos, Banks, Bear,
Brady, Brown, G, Filer, Geringer, Hoeft, Johnson,
Knapp, Lien, Locke, McCann, Ottman, Riggins,
Rodriguez-Williams, Schmid, Smith, S, Styvar, Tarver,
Washut, Webber, Wharff and Wylie and Senator(s)
Hicks, Kolb, Laursen, D, McKeown, Pearson, Smith, D
and Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to concealed weapons; repealing gun free zones; providing for
the carrying of concealed weapons as specified; creating a criminal offense for
prohibiting entry to a person carrying a concealed weapon as specified;
clarifying that only the state legislature may regulate firearms, weapons and
ammunition; providing for exceptions; requiring rulemaking; and providing for
an effective date.
